id: JUDGE5-3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: reject_scene
target: crates/core/src/command_class.rs
find:     Ok(CommandClass::NotInThisStep(kind))
replace:     Ok(CommandClass::WrongOrder)
expect-fail: playthrough_pairs_are_classified_100_percent
expect-fail: builtin_and_skill_are_not_in_this_step_when_not_accepted
note: builtin・skill を wrong_order に倒す（この Step では使わない入力が順序違いになる）
